                                        type yang:counter64;
                                        description
                                            "The number of HTTP header modifications that were not made for anti-spoofing
                                             due to an HTTP header field value being short enough to result in a packet size increase
                                             if anti-spoofing were applied. A value of 0 is returned if the value of anti-spoof is disabled.";
